{
  "id": "functions-parabola",
  "title": "Functions: The Parabola",
  "term": 2,
  "summary": "The quadratic function $y = ax^2 + q$: the effect of $a$ and $q$, turning point, axis of symmetry, intercepts, domain and range, and finding the equation from a graph.",
